title: "The Comprehensive List of AI Evaluation Tools"
abstract: "A comprehensive, curated list of open-source and commercial tools, frameworks, platforms, and benchmarks for evaluating AI systems — LLMs, RAG pipelines, AI agents, voice agents, and multimodal models. Includes a machine-readable catalog (data/tools.json, data/tools.csv)."
